    "intro_narrative": "You are the Chief Engineer of the stellar cruiser Aethelgard. Waking from cryosleep, you find the ship adrift in the void, systems critical and the main reactor offline. The AI is unresponsive, leaving only the manual override subsystems active. To restart the core and survive, you must navigate the complex web of backup protocols, synchronize the drifting navigation arrays, and synthesize the Core Activation Key. The silence of space is deafening; time is running out before life support fails completely.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
